<title>USA: IPO PRICING-LCC prices $16/shr, above range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-LCC prices $16/shr, above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  LCC International Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $16.00</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $13 to $15</p>
